                "text": "I recently met with Julie and Talan Yorn, advocates for Lyme disease awareness. We discussed the need for research, funding, testing, and early diagnosis of Lyme disease. Additionally, we emphasized the importance of education for doctors, healthcare providers, and schools, as our children are the most susceptible to Lyme disease.",
